## Story Description
Overhaul the Overview page: replace the category pie chart with SpendTreemap, add three signal badges linking to WC opportunity/recommendations/data issues, apply accentColor to Maverick Spend KPI card based on risk level, and add spend share % to the supplier bar chart labels.

## Acceptance Criteria
- Edit file: frontend/src/pages/dashboard/OverviewPage.tsx
- Import SpendTreemap from @/components/charts and CHART_COLORS from @/components/charts/constants
- Replace the SpendPieChart in the col-span-2 grid cell with SpendTreemap. Pass data as categoryPieData mapped to include a color per entry: categoryPieData.map((d, i) => ({ ...d, color: CHART_COLORS[i % CHART_COLORS.length] })). Pass title='Spend by Category' and valueFormatter
- Add a useQuery for payment terms: queryKey ['pt-overview', engagementId], queryFn fetches /api/engagements/${engagementId}/cube/by-payment-terms, enabled: !!engagementId. Compute totalWcOpportunity = ptData.reduce((s,r) => s + (r.wc_opportunity_aud ?? 0), 0)
- Add a useQuery for recommendations: queryKey ['rec-overview', engagementId], queryFn fetches /api/engagements/${engagementId}/recommendations with retry: false. Extract recCount = recData?.recommendations?.length ?? 0. Handle 404 gracefully (recCount stays 0).
- Add a useQuery for diagnostics: queryKey ['diag-overview', engagementId], queryFn fetches /api/engagements/${engagementId}/cube/diagnostics. Compute redCount = count of checks where status === 'RED' or status === 'ALERT'
- Add a signal badges row between the KPI cards grid and the area chart. Render three clickable card-badges using Link from react-router-dom: (1) Link to='payment-terms': DollarSign icon text-emerald-600, label 'WC Opportunity', value formatCurrency(totalWcOpportunity). (2) Link to='recommendations': Lightbulb icon text-blue-600, label 'Recommendations', value recCount or '—'. (3) Link to='quality': AlertTriangle icon, color text-rose-600 if redCount>0 else text-slate-400, label 'Data Issues', value redCount. Each badge is a div with className='flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg border bg-card hover:bg-muted/50 transition-colors cursor-pointer'
- Update Maverick Spend KPI card: add accentColor prop dynamically — if maverick_spend_pct > 25 use 'risk', if > 10 use 'amber', else use 'green'
- Update Total Spend KPI card: add accentColor='neutral'
- Import DollarSign, Lightbulb, AlertTriangle from lucide-react. Import Link from react-router-dom.
- Run: cd frontend && npm run build — should succeed with zero TypeScript errors

