## Story Description
Replace the static bucket bar chart with a supplier-ranked WC opportunity chart. Add user-adjustable WACC % and target days inputs. Re-sort the supplier table by WC opportunity descending. Apply accentColor to the Total WC Opportunity KPI card.

## Acceptance Criteria
- Edit file: frontend/src/pages/dashboard/PaymentTermsPage.tsx
- Replace the const WACC = 0.08 and const TARGET_DAYS = 45 constants with useState: const [waccPct, setWaccPct] = useState(8) and const [targetDays, setTargetDays] = useState(45). Update computeSupplierWc to use waccPct / 100 and targetDays.
- Add an Assumptions section above the charts. A div with className='flex items-center gap-6 p-4 bg-muted/30 rounded-lg border mb-2'. Inside: two labelled input groups. Group 1: label 'Target Days' text-xs, Input type='number' min=30 max=120 value={targetDays} onChange={e => setTargetDays(Number(e.target.value))} className='w-20'. Group 2: label 'WACC %' text-xs, Input type='number' min=1 max=20 step={0.5} value={waccPct} onChange={e => setWaccPct(Number(e.target.value))} className='w-20'. Add a text-xs text-muted-foreground note: 'WC opportunity = (target − current days) / 365 × spend × WACC'.
