- Retain the existing bucket bar chart below the opportunity chart but wrap it in a smaller container: div className='mt-4'.
- Re-sort suppliersSorted: change the sort from ascending avg_payment_days to descending WC opportunity. Replace: .sort((a, b) => (a.avg_payment_days ?? 0) - (b.avg_payment_days ?? 0)) with: .sort((a, b) => computeSupplierWc(b.avg_payment_days ?? 0, b.total_spend ?? 0) - computeSupplierWc(a.avg_payment_days ?? 0, a.total_spend ?? 0))
- Apply accentColor='opportunity' to the Total WC Opportunity KpiCard
